{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"AccessTokens\">Access Tokens</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"AccessToken AccessTokens Find Is On Other Settings To ToDate\">Access tokens allow you to connect Manager with other software or automate tasks using the API. You can find this feature in the <strong>Settings</strong> tab under <strong>Access Tokens</strong>.</p><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center gap-2 p-4\"><i class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 fas fa-fw fa-robot\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"AccessTokens\">Access Tokens</span></span></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"AccessToken Create NewAccessToken On To ToDate\">Click the <strong>New Access Token</strong> button to create a new <em>access token</em>.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg flex gap-4 shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"AccessTokens\">Access Tokens</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewAccessToken\">New Access Token</span></span></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"AccessToken On To ToDate\">Once you have obtained the <em>access token</em>, you can use it to authenticate with the Manager API.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"On To ToDate\">To see all available API endpoints, click the <strong>API</strong> button in the bottom-right corner of the screen.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pb-4 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 p-3 border-b\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"border text-xs rounded py-1 px-2 bg-white border-neutral-300 text-neutral-400\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"API\">API</span></span></div></div></div>",
  "key": "access-tokens"
}
